% c069 (playability/balance; Adler2 PDF 26, Schuller: loud high unison horns crack, keep high loud lines to Hn 1 (and 3); PDF 27: horn with cello on a sustained line): 250 and 265-268 Hn 2 an octave below Hn 1 (C4, with the cellos at 265-268), so the low horn is not on written G5 ff in unison.
